        <mxCell id="flow-legend" value="Flow&#10;1. External client enters via the ingress Service&#10;2. Ingress Service routes to the ingress controller&#10;3. Ingress controller to the app Service&#10;4. App Service to the app Deployment&#10;5. Deployment manages its ReplicaSet&#10;6. ReplicaSet runs the first Pod&#10;7. ReplicaSet runs the second Pod&#10;8. App Pod calls the data Service&#10;9. Data Service to the StatefulSet&#10;10. StatefulSet persists to its PersistentVolumeClaim&#10;11. ConfigMap configures the Deployment&#10;12. HPA scales the ReplicaSet&#10;13. ServiceAccount identity for the second Pod&#10;14. Secret mounted by the StatefulSet&#10;15. API server stores state in etcd" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3130" y="120" width="280" height="324" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&#10;Solid line = primary flow&#10;Dashed line = asynchronous / event-driven flow&#10;Red = blocked / missing / disabled&#10;🆕 = new in version N&#10;🔄 = changed in version N&#10;Outer boundary = stack Boundary (captioned; provider style)&#10;Numbered markers (1..N) = ordered data flow steps; see Flow list&#10;supporting = ops / observability service (dotted outline); not a data-flow step" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
